WEBVTT

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:33.446
of the Ejagham people in southern Nigeria.

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:37.316
So it's a special-interest writing system.

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:40.891
The Akan of people of Ghana
and [Cote d'Ivoire]

00:01:40.915 --> 00:01:44.936
developed Adinkra symbols
some 400 years ago,

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:48.804
and these are proverbs,
historical sayings,

00:01:48.828 --> 00:01:51.514
objects, animals, plants,

00:01:51.538 --> 00:01:53.522
and my favorite Adinkra system

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.898
is the first one at the top on the left.

00:01:55.922 --> 00:01:56.900
It's called Sankofa.

00:01:56.924 --> 00:02:02.894
It means, "Return and get
it." Learn from the past.